    <string name="library_empty_title">Library is empty</string>
    <string name="library_empty_body">Choose the folder with your visual novels. Each game lives in its own subfolder containing vilevn.pck; picking a game folder directly works too. On first launch the game files are copied into the app storage - no storage permission is needed, and your savegames stay where they are.</string>
